2026-10-18 18:07:21 India Standard Time | INFO     | NeuroSan:_log:821 - NeuroSan - {"message": "Successfully loaded the following tools: [StructuredTool(name='you-search', description='Search the web for current information, facts, news, and sources.\n>\nBest for: current events, facts about people, companies, and organizations, finding primary sources, verifying claims.\nReturns: ranked results with URLs and snippets — read them with you-contents before answering; snippets are not page content.\n>\nQuery tips:\n- One intent per search, phrased naturally: "tariff exemptions for semiconductor imports 2026" — not a question, not a pile of synonyms.\n- Inline filters are mapped automatically: `site:cdc.gov`, `lang:fr`, `loc:DE`.\n- On zero results, don\'t repeat the query: drop exact-phrase ("quoted") constraints first, then widen — keep domain filters unless the domain itself was wrong. Or read the best prior result with you-contents.', args_schema={'type': 'object', '$schema': 'https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema', 'properties': {'query': {'type': 'string', 'minLength': 1, 'description': 'Short natural-language phrase describing one thing to find, e.g. "tariff exemptions for semiconductor imports 2026". Inline `site:`, `lang:`, `loc:` filters are mapped automatically. Max 50 words / 400 characters after operator mapping.'}, 'count': {'default': 30, 'description': 'Max results per section', 'type': 'integer', 'minimum': 1, 'maximum': 100}, 'freshness': {'description': 'Limit results to a recent window. Use it when recency matters — news, prices, releases, "this year" — and omit it for evergreen facts. Pass a named bucket (`day`, `week`, `month`, `year`) or a date range `YYYY-MM-DDtoYYYY-MM-DD`. If the query already names a timeframe, the broader of the two wins, so this can only widen, never narrow, the query phrase.', 'type': 'string'}, 'offset': {'description': 'Pagination offset, in multiples of count. count=5 and offset=1 returns results 5–10. Range 0–9. Omit on the first page.', 'type': 'integer', 'minimum': 0, 'maximum': 9}, 'extraction': {'default': 'highlights', 'description': 'Extraction mode. "highlights" (default) returns query-relevant passages; "none" returns plain snippets; "full_page" crawls each result and returns full page content.', 'type': 'string', 'enum': ['none', 'highlights', 'full_page']}, 'knowledge': {'description': 'Include licensed knowledge results relevant to the query. core requests factual answers alongside web and news results; matching results appear in results.knowledge.', 'type': 'string', 'enum': ['core']}, 'safesearch': {'description': 'Content-moderation filter. Omit to let the API default (moderate) apply.', 'type': 'string', 'enum': ['off', 'moderate', 'strict']}, 'extraction_source': {'description': "Where full-page content comes from when extraction is 'full_page'. 'cache' is included in base cost, 'fetch' bills at livecrawl rates, 'blend' bills only for pages not in cache.", 'type': 'string', 'enum': ['cache', 'fetch', 'blend']}, 'crawl_timeout': {'description': 'Max seconds to wait for page content when extraction is full_page (1–60). Omit for the default 10.', 'type': 'integer', 'minimum': 1, 'maximum': 60}, 'exclude_domains': {'description': 'Domains to exclude from search results (up to 500). Cannot be combined with inline `site:` filters, which map to include_domains.', 'maxItems': 500, 'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'string'}}}, 'required': ['query']}, tags=['langchain_tool'], metadata={'title': None, 'readOnlyHint': True, 'destructiveHint': False, 'idempotentHint': None, 'openWorldHint': True, '_meta': {'co.baseten/llm-controllable-params-default': ['query', 'freshness'], 'com.you.com/search': {'description': 'Host-supplied search overrides. Send an object under the `com.you.com/search` key in tools/call params._meta (or X-Search-* HTTP headers); every field is optional and wins over model-supplied arguments. Host-only fields (language, country, include_domains, boost_domains) are settable here and never by the model.', 'schema': {'$schema': 'https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema', 'type': 'object', 'properties': {'count': {'type': 'integer', 'minimum': 1, 'maximum': 100}, 'extraction': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['none', 'highlights', 'full_page']}, 'extraction_source': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['cache', 'fetch', 'blend']}, 'knowledge': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['core']}, 'exclude_domains': {'maxItems': 500, 'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'string'}}, 'safesearch': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['off', 'moderate', 'strict']}, 'crawl_timeout': {'type': 'integer', 'minimum': 1, 'maximum': 60}, 'language': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['AR', 'EU', 'BN', 'BG', 'CA', 'ZH-HANS', 'ZH-HANT', 'HR', 'CS', 'DA', 'NL', 'EN', 'EN-GB', 'ET', 'FI', 'FR', 'GL', 'DE', 'EL', 'GU', 'HE', 'HI', 'HU', 'IS', 'IT', 'JA', 'KN', 'KO', 'LV', 'LT', 'MS', 'ML', 'MR', 'NB', 'PL', 'PT-BR', 'PT-PT', 'PA', 'RO', 'RU', 'SR', 'SK', 'SL', 'ES', 'SV', 'TA', 'TE', 'TH', 'TR', 'UK', 'VI']}, 'country': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['AR', 'AU', 'AT', 'BE', 'BR', 'CA', 'CL', 'DK', 'FI', 'FR', 'DE', 'HK', 'IN', 'ID', 'IT', 'JP', 'KR', 'MY', 'MX', 'NL', 'NZ', 'NO', 'CN', 'PL', 'PT', 'PH', 'RU', 'SA', 'ZA', 'ES', 'SE', 'CH', 'TW', 'TR', 'GB', 'US']}, 'include_domains': {'maxItems': 500, 'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'string'}}, 'boost_domains': {'maxItems': 500, 'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'string'}}}, 'additionalProperties': False}}}}, response_format='content_and_artifact', coroutine=<bound method McpToolErrorHandler.async_invoke of <neuro_san.internals.run_context.langchain.mcp.mcp_tool_error_handler.McpToolErrorHandler object at 0x00000258E1AD5460>>)]", "user_id": "None", "Timestamp": "2026-10-18T18:07:21.625090", "source": "Http Server", "message_type": "Other", "request_id": "request-8"}
